# CocoaPods: the AMap SDK is vendored by `pod install` (apps/ios), never committed.
# Commit Podfile, Podfile.lock and RAI.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata instead.
apps/ios/Pods/

# AMap iOS SDK key: local only, injected into the generated Pods xcconfig by the Podfile.
# Template is committed as apps/ios/Configs/AmapKey.xcconfig.example.
apps/ios/Configs/AmapKey.xcconfig

# Generated data audit is a runtime report, not maintained project documentation
/docs/DATA_AUDIT.md

# `.archify/` holds read-only audit output. Its interactive HTML diagrams and the
# spec JSON that produced them ARE tracked; its prose reports are not, for the same
# reason /docs/DATA_AUDIT.md is not — they are a dated point-in-time snapshot.
# check-doc-line-refs.mjs names this exact case ("带日期的时点快照不能用来判漂移…
# 回写等于伪造历史"), and check-doc-links.mjs would otherwise require every one of
# them to be reachable from README.md.
/.archify/**/*.md
